  "principles": [
    "No universal numeric source-credibility score.",
    "A source may be highly authoritative for one predicate and weak for another.",
    "Unknown dependency never counts as independent corroboration.",
    "Constitutive and contemporaneous authoritative records may establish some predicates without a second source.",
    "Material contradiction yields CONTESTED even when supporting evidence is otherwise strong."
